              11                       ! Method:
              12                       !
              13                       ! This routine is called from subroutines:
              14                       !    *cubase*   (t and q at condenstion level)
              15                       !    *cuasc*    (t and q at cloud levels)
              16                       !    *cuini*    (environmental t and qs values at half levels)
              17                       ! input are unadjusted t and q values,
              18                       ! it returns adjusted values of t and q
              19                       ! note: input parameter kcall defines calculation as
              20                       !    kcall=0    env. t and qs in*cuini*
              21                       !    kcall=1    condensation in updrafts  (e.g. cubase, cuasc)
              22                       !    kcall=2    evaporation in downdrafts (e.g. cudlfs,cuddraf)
              23                       !
              24                       ! Externals:
              25                       ! 3 lookup tables ( tlucua, tlucub, tlucuc )
              26                       ! for condensation calculations.
              27                       ! the tables are initialised in *setphys*.
              28                       !
              29                       ! Authors:
              30                       !
